MEM SIZE? REM t21: MID$ statement, OUT no-op, LPRINT/LLIST (discard mode in sweep)

R/S L2 BASIC
------------------------------
TRS-80 LEVEL II BASIC emulator
 Codeveloped with Claude, 2026
------------------------------
man pages available for all BASIC commands
"help meta" to display supported metacommands
READY
>10 A$="HELLO WORLD"
>20 MID$(A$,7)="THERE"
>30 PRINT A$
>40 MID$(A$,1,3)="XYZZY"
>50 PRINT A$
>60 DIM B$(3): B$(2)="ABCDEF"
>70 MID$(B$(2),3,2)="12345"
>80 PRINT B$(2)
>90 DEFSTR C
>100 C="ABCD": MID$(C,2)="XY": PRINT C
>110 MID$(A$,10)="LONGTAIL"
>120 PRINT A$; LEN(A$)
>130 OUT 255,1
>140 OUT 128+127,0
>150 PRINT "OUT OK"
>160 LPRINT "P1";TAB(10);"COL10"
>170 LPRINT "A","B"
>180 LPRINT USING "##.#"; 3.14
>190 PRINT "LPRINT OK"
>200 ON ERROR GOTO 300
>210 MID$(A$,99)="X"
>220 PRINT "NOT REACHED": END
>300 PRINT "FC =";(ERR=8): RESUME 310
>310 END
>RUN
HELLO THERE
XYZLO THERE
AB12EF
AXYD
XYZLO THELO 11 
OUT OK
LPRINT OK
FC =-1 
READY
>LLIST
READY
>BYE
exit=0
